Multirotor mixer for PX4FMU
===========================

This file defines a single mixer for a quadrotor in the H configuration.  All controls
are mixed 100%.

R: 4h

Gimbal / payload mixer for last two channels
-----------------------------------------------------

#M: 1
#S: 3 5  10000  10000      0 -10000  10000

#M: 1
#S: 3 6  10000  10000      0 -10000  10000

# quad_hY.main.mix
# Custom quad X mixer:
# Front motors (0,2): roll + pitch, no yaw
# Rear motors (1,3): yaw + pitch, no roll

M: 0 1.000  1.000  1.000  0.000
M: 1 1.000  0.000  1.000 -1.000
M: 2 1.000 -1.000  1.000  0.000
M: 3 1.000  0.000  1.000  1.000
